ays been a partner  to the people of afghanistan but we've  done so in  uh  joining the uh the military missions  that have been  implemented in the past and of course we  were part of  operation resolute support but alongside  we invest 50 60 million euros a year  in sustainable development and  humanitarian assistance  for the people of afghanistan i think i  can only load  the state of qatar for its patients  for its stance on mediation and efforts  continuous to  provide the platform and the channels  where the parties that need to talk to  each other  can talk to each other and that's  extremely important in international  diplomacy exclusion is easy inclusion  requires a lot of patience and  commitments and i think we all look  towards qatar and i'm sure you'll see a  number of government plays land and take  off land and take off and that's i think  the best recognition any government can  have in terms of its role and the  expectations of his role so i wish you  uh  and continuous engagement because i  think we all look towards qatar for the  leadership role it has played thank you  so much

